    {"step": 1, "tactic": "klist purge to rotate Kerberos ticket cache", "technique": "T1550.003", "what_happened": "At 2026-05-17 13:14:12 UTC, Sysmon EID 1 captured klist.exe purge with ParentImage=powershell.exe and CommandLine='klist.exe purge'. Rule 92055 triggered.", "chain_reason": "klist purge wipes the cached Kerberos tickets so that a forged/injected ticket can be used without conflict. Step required before pass-the-ticket / overpass-the-hash injection."},
    {"step": 2, "tactic": "Rubeus asktgt with /rc4:<NTLM_HASH>", "technique": "T1550.003", "what_happened": "At 2026-05-17 13:14:18, AMSI EID 4104 captured scriptblock containing literal 'Rubeus.exe asktgt /user:svc_sql /rc4:AABBCCDD00112233 /domain:CORP.LOCAL /ptt'. Sysmon EID 1 same time captured Rubeus.exe process start with ParentImage=powershell.exe. Rule 92056 triggered.", "chain_reason": "Rubeus asktgt with /rc4 flag = Overpass-the-Hash. The /ptt flag injects the resulting TGT directly into the current session memory. Rubeus.exe binary itself is malware."},
    {"step": 3, "tactic": "DECISIVE — DC 4768 TGT request TicketEncryptionType=0x17 (RC4) on AES-only corp baseline", "technique": "T1550.003", "what_happened": "At 2026-05-17 13:14:22, DC-01 Security EID 4768 captured TGT request for TargetUserName=svc_sql, IpAddress=10.20.45.15 (WS-IT-15), TicketEncryptionType=0x17 (RC4_HMAC_MD5). Corp Kerberos baseline mandates AES (0x12); previous 90-day TGT requests for svc_sql were exclusively 0x12. Rule 18202 triggered.", "chain_reason": "DECISIVE: a 4768 TGT request with RC4 (0x17) on an account whose 90-day baseline is AES (0x12) is the canonical Overpass-the-Hash fingerprint. The attacker possesses the NTLM hash (= RC4 Kerberos key) but not the AES keys, so Rubeus/mimikatz can only forge RC4 tickets."},
    {"step": 4, "tactic": "Lateral movement — service ticket request 4769 for CIFS/SRV-DB-02", "technique": "T1550.003", "what_happened": "At 2026-05-17 13:14:28, DC-01 Security EID 4769 captured service ticket request TargetUserName=svc_sql, ServiceName=CIFS/SRV-DB-02.corp.local, IpAddress=10.20.45.15, TicketEncryptionType=0x17. Service ticket issued under the forged TGT. Rule 18203 triggered.", "chain_reason": "Post-OPtH, attacker requests service tickets to access target resources. RC4 service ticket continues the downgrade signature."}
